# Derived experimental crystallographic data transcription, not a publisher CIF.
# Source: H. Schulz and K. H. Thiemann, Solid State Communications 23 (1977)
# 815-819. DOI: 10.1016/0038-1098(77)90959-0.
# a,c: published p.816 Table 1, explicitly in angstroms.
# x,y,z: p.816 Table 2 and its common-coordinate footnote.
# x=-1/3,y=-2/3 are encoded as long decimal approximations only.
# P63mc encodes the standard wurtzite setting described by the publication;
# the numeric space-group identifier is not printed in the article.
# Unit site occupancy expresses the published stoichiometric ordered model;
# it is not a separately reported/refined occupancy measurement.
# The isotropic U column of Table 2 is multiplied by 100 in the paper;
# below it is divided by 100 to encode U_iso in angstrom squared.
# Measurement temperature and pressure are unreported and left unknown.
# No idealization, lattice rescaling, bond equalization or DFT relaxation.
# Numeric facts transcribed with original article attribution; the article
# itself remains subject to its publisher rights and is not redistributed.
